        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ecce Confessor magnus, qui quasi stella matutina in medio nebulae, et quasi luna plena in diebus suis lucet, et quasi sol refulgens: sic ille effulsit in templo Dei.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
